sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Diagramme d'Interaction des Classes Internes : Course Content Service

    participant Ctrl as CourseController
    participant Svc as CourseService
    participant AuthClient as AuthRestClient
    participant CourseRepo as CourseRepository
    participant ProgRepo as UserProgressRepository
    participant ProgEnt as UserProgress (Entity)
    participant CodeConsumer as CodePassedEventConsumer
    participant EventPub as RabbitMQEventPublisher

    Note over Ctrl,CourseRepo: Scénario 1 : Création de Cours (Validation Synchrone REST)
    Ctrl->>Svc: createCourse(CreateCourseDto)
    Svc->>AuthClient: getInstructorSummary(instructorId) [REST Synchrone]
    AuthClient-->>Svc: InstructorSummaryDto(isActive=true)
    Svc->>CourseRepo: save(courseDocument)
    CourseRepo-->>Svc: Course saved
    Svc-->>Ctrl: CourseResponseDto

    Note over CodeConsumer,EventPub: Scénario 2 : Validation d'Avancement (Consommation & Publication)
    CodeConsumer->>Svc: handleCodeSolutionPassed(CodeSolutionPassedEvent)
    Svc->>ProgRepo: findByUserIdAndCourseId(userId, courseId)
    ProgRepo-->>Svc: userProgress
    Svc->>ProgEnt: markLessonCompleted(exerciseId)
    Svc->>ProgEnt: recalculatePercentage()
    Svc->>ProgRepo: save(userProgress)
    alt Si 100% complété
        Svc->>EventPub: publishCourseCompletedEvent(userId, courseId) [RabbitMQ]
    end
